---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="页面走丢了" description="这个地址暂时没有页面，回到 yyg 的博客继续探索。">
  <section class="not-found surface" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <div class="route-symbol glass" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
    <p class="error-code">404</p>
    <h1 id="not-found-title">好像走远了一点。</h1>
    <p class="error-description">这个地址没有找到页面。<br />也许链接已经变动，笔记还在别的地方等你。</p>
    <div class="error-actions"><a class="home-action" href="/">回到首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="archive-action" href="/archive/">翻翻归档</a></div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .not-found { text-align: center; padding: 60px 28px 66px; max-width: 800px; margin: 42px auto 0; }
  .route-symbol { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 66px; height: 66px; margin: 0 auto 32px; border-radius: 22px; color: var(--blue); font-size: 32px; }
  .error-code { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .23em; color: var(--text-tertiary); }
  h1 { margin: 16px 0; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1.35; }
  .error-description { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.95; }
  .error-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .error-actions a { font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; }
  .home-action { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; padding: 12px 20px; color: white; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 999px; }
  .archive-action { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .archive-action:hover { color: var(--blue); }
  @media (max-width: 540px) { .not-found { margin-top: 24px; padding: 46px 22px 50px; } .error-description { font-size: 13px; } }
</style>
